# 8. SPLIT TRANSACTION

A single payment must be divisible into multiple categories and people.

Example:

Total expense: ৳2,000

| Category | Person | Amount |
|---|---|---:|
| Food | Family | ৳1,000 |
| Shopping | Personal | ৳600 |
| Household | Wife | ৳400 |

The sum of all split lines must exactly equal the main transaction amount.

Validation:

sum(splitLines.amount) === transaction.amount

Do not allow saving if the totals do not match.

Display the expense correctly in:

- Category Reports
- Person Reports
- Account Reports
- Monthly Reports

Never count the parent transaction and its split lines as separate expenses.

